1SY1AxaDJ2aFg1YWE0LXpMYXgyZ09XLXR6T0w4Z2RxUW93M0dKNmx3a0FFUWlYbVBhOWRaYXFaUklBT2lPUzZZTHpEYlNpNTBvM1NzS2NzY29HdjY3OVhEV2t2MzZ4NTdJbHdDT3A3QTd6MkpKS0RGeDZ0clNNQlBrTUpRNzBCVUR3eWRORmZ2NENlcUtnZGZHZWhBOFNhVkxwcDI?oc=5","date":"2026-11-11","zh":"馬賽克股價連續 5 天上漲 25%"},{"title":"Mosaic (MOS) Stock May Be Below Fair Value As Loss Recovery Hopes Build","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-11","zh":"隨著損失恢復希望的建立，馬賽克（MOS）股票可能低於公允價值"},{"title":"Are Wall Street Analysts Bullish on Mosaic Stock?","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxObW9Od2Y0aEZiZ3IzcGowZVlFX2E4ejlDRXJ3VkJFbzEzYU54aDFCejFWYUl1SlJMWVRtU0ZkYWhKRmFaVXJRdVpkN004U3B5dVNOc3FXajVsSVJkX2ViZGZfNXd1LVRnWDZiYVJRZWRFSm1xNVBkaTI0eWhscVFScVBpRGtJV3lTbmhwRmNrQkdtSkFGMEFvN0dBNF9qMGY0aFE?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":""}],"order_news":[{"title":"Form 4 The Mosaic Company For: 4 November By Investing.com","src":"Investing.com Canada","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNcHdUcG5US29nSHhFc3VfdG5GY1czRmFDUXo3Szc3cHlJaE5UdkRWSFZmVTNaVFlnWEFYUkNSNzY1c3dnZjZqM1pJVWtEQnR4Y2hyTzFmcDI4UUV5ZjNXUVR3SE9vLXNTSGZBXzlINDc5MzdiWHNYRGJYN0txSVNCeXMwdWRsWFRJVVlrajh2WmxJQzBPRjNmNGJORGlZSGktU2hr?oc=5","date":"2026-11-04","zh":"表 4 The Mosaic Company 日期：11 月 4 日 作者：Investing.com"},{"title":"MOS: Sulfur-constrained phosphate faces a Q4 trough as potash demand and cost actions bolster recovery prospects","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-04","zh":"MOS：由於鉀肥需求和成本行動提振復甦前景，限硫磷酸鹽面臨第四季低谷"},{"title":"MOS: Lower volumes and input costs drove a Q3 loss as cash flow and fertilizer demand improved","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-03","zh":"MOS：隨著現金流和化肥需求改善，銷售和投入成本下降導致第三季虧損"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-27","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1285785/000128578526000017/mos-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The Mosaic Company is the world's leading producer and marketer of concentrated phosphate and potash crop nutrients. Through our broad product offering, we are a single source supplier of phosphate- and potash-based crop nutrients and animal feed ingredients. We serve customers in approximately 40 countries. We are the second largest integrated phosphate producer in the world and one of the largest producers and marketers of phosphate-based animal feed ingredients in North America and Brazil. We are the leading fertilizer production and distribution company in Brazil. We mine phosphate rock in Florida, Brazil and Peru. We process rock into finished phosphate products at facilities in Florida, Louisiana and Brazil. We are typically one of the top four global potash producers in the world. We mine potash in Saskatchewan and New Mexico. We have other production, blending or distribution ope","zh":"馬賽克公司是全球領先的濃縮磷酸鹽和鉀肥作物營養素生產商和銷售商。透過我們廣泛的產品供應，我們成為磷酸鹽和鉀肥作物營養素和動物飼料成分的單一來源供應商。我們為大約 40 個國家的客戶提供服務。我們是世界第二大綜合磷酸鹽生產商，也是北美和巴西最大的磷酸鹽動物飼料原料生產商和銷售商之一。我們是巴西領先的化肥生產和分銷公司。我們在佛羅裡達州、巴西和秘魯開採磷礦。我們在佛羅裡達州、路易斯安那州和巴西的工廠將岩石加工成磷酸鹽成品。我們通常是全球四大鉀肥生產商之一。我們在薩斯喀徹溫省和新墨西哥州開採鉀肥。我們還有其他生產、混合或分銷業務"},{"en":"The Mosaic Company is a Delaware corporation that was incorporated in March 2004 and serves as the parent company of the business that was formed through the October 2004 combination of IMC Global Inc. (\"IMC\") and the fertilizer businesses of Cargill, Incorporated. We are publicly traded on the New York Stock Exchange under the ticker symbol \"MOS\" and are headquartered in Tampa, Florida.","zh":"Mosaic Company 是一家特拉華州公司，成立於 2004 年 3 月，是 IMC Global Inc.（「IMC」）和嘉吉公司化肥業務於 2004 年 10 月合併而成的企業的母公司。我們在紐約證券交易所公開交易，股票代號為“MOS”，總部位於佛羅裡達州坦帕。"},{"en":"We conduct our business through wholly- and majority-owned subsidiaries as well as businesses in which we own less than a majority or a non-controlling interest. We are organized into three reportable business segments: Phosphate, Potash and Mosaic Fertilizantes. Intersegment eliminations, unrealized mark-to-market gains/losses on derivatives and investment in equity securities of Saudi Arabian Mining Company (\"Ma'aden\"), debt expenses and the results of the China and India distribution businesses and Mosaic Biosciences are included within Corporate, Eliminations and Other.","zh":"我們透過全資和多數股權的子公司以及我們擁有少於多數或非控制權益的業務開展業務。我們分為三個可報告業務部門：磷酸鹽、鉀肥和馬賽克肥料。部門間抵銷、沙烏地阿拉伯礦業公司（「Ma'aden」）的衍生性商品和股本證券投資的未實現以市價計價損益、債務支出以及中國和印度分銷業務以及 Mosaic Biosciences 的業績均包含在公司、抵銷和其他中。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"To service the needs of our customers, our Mosaic Fertilizantes segment includes a network of strategically located sales offices, crop nutrient blending and bagging facilities, port terminals and warehouse distribution facilities that we own and operate. The blending and bagging facilities primarily produce Blends from phosphate, potash and nitrogen. The average product mix in our Blends (by volume) contains approximately 21% nitrogen, 52% phosphate and 27% potash, although this mix differs based on seasonal and other factors. All of our production in Brazil is consumed within the country.","zh":"為了滿足客戶的需求，我們的馬賽克肥料部門包括我們擁有和經營的策略性銷售辦事處網路、作物養分混合和裝袋設施、港口碼頭和倉庫配送設施。混合和裝袋設施主要生產磷酸鹽、鉀肥和氮氣的混合物。我們的混合物中的平均產品組合（按體積計）含有約 21% 的氮、52% 的磷酸鹽和 27% 的鉀，儘管這種組合因季節和其他因素而異。我們在巴西生產的所有產品均在國內消費。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Because crop nutrients are global commodities available from numerous sources, crop nutrition companies compete primarily on the basis of delivered price. Other competitive factors include product quality, cost and availability of raw materials, customer service, plant efficiency and availability of product. As a result, markets for our products are highly competitive. We compete with a broad range of domestic and international producers, including farmer cooperatives, subsidiaries of larger companies, and independent crop nutrient companies. Foreign competitors may have access to less expensive raw materials, may not have to comply with as stringent regulatory requirements or are owned or subsidized by governments and, as a result, may have cost advantages over North American companies. We believe that our extensive North American and international production and distribution system pro","zh":"由於作物營養素是全球商品，來源眾多，因此作物營養公司主要根據交貨價格競爭。其他競爭因素包括產品品質、原材料成本和可用性、客戶服務、工廠效率和產品可用性。因此，我們產品的市場競爭非常激烈。我們與廣泛的國內和國際生產商競爭，包括農民合作社、大公司的子公司和獨立的作物營養素公司。外國競爭對手可能可以獲得較便宜的原材料，可能不必遵守嚴格的監管要求，或由政府擁有或補貼，因此可能比北美公司具有成本優勢。我們相信，我們廣泛的北美和國際生產和分銷系統"},{"en":"Unlike many of our competitors, we have our own distribution system to sell phosphate- and potash-based crop nutrients and animal feed ingredients, whether produced by us or by other third parties, around the globe. In North America, we have one of the largest and most strategically located distribution systems for crop nutrients, including warehouse facilities in key agricultural regions. We also have an extensive network of distribution facilities internationally, including in the key growth regions of South America and Asia, with port terminals, warehouses and blending plants in Brazil, Paraguay, China and India. Our global presence allows us to efficiently serve customers in approximately 40 countries.","zh":"與我們的許多競爭對手不同，我們擁有自己的分銷系統，可以在全球範圍內銷售基於磷酸鹽和鉀肥的農作物營養素和動物飼料成分，無論是我們還是其他第三方生產的。在北美，我們擁有最大且最具戰略意義的作物養分分配系統之一，包括位於主要農業地區的倉庫設施。我們在國際上也擁有廣泛的分銷設施網路，包括在南美洲和亞洲的主要成長地區，在巴西、巴拉圭、中國和印度設有港口碼頭、倉庫和混合工廠。我們的全球業務使我們能夠有效率地為約 40 個國家的客戶提供服務。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Mosaic Fertilizantes","val":4847300000,"zh":"花葉肥料"},{"name":"Phosphates","val":4576500000,"zh":"磷酸鹽部門"},{"name":"Potash","val":2661700000,"zh":"鉀鹽部門"}],"total":12052400000}},"peers":["CF","NTR","IPI","BG","FCX"]}}